 descoberto na China\",\"section\":\"Ciência\",\"summary\":\"Fóssil de 57 centímetros preserva partes da plumagem e indica que aves e parentes próximos desenvolveram adaptações semelhantes por caminhos evolutivos diferentes.\",\"title\":\"Novo dinossauro com penas é descoberto na China; descoberta traz pistas sobre evolução do voo\",\"url\":\"https://g1.globo.com/ciencia/noticia/2026/09/29/novo-dinossauro-com-penas-e-descoberto-na-china-descoberta-traz-pistas-sobre-evolucao-do-voo.ghtml\",\"video\":null},\"created\":\"2026-09-29T15:00:00.462Z\",\"feedId\":\"\",\"id\":\"e9784e0e92621aba1efbed196b95d9c2\",\"lastPublication\":\"2026-09-29T15:00:01.217Z\",\"modified\":\"2026-09-29T15:00:01.217Z\",\"publication\":\"2026-09-29T15:00:00.462Z\",\"tenantId\":\"g1\",\"type\":\"materia\"}],\"feedId\":\"b904b430-123a-4f93-8cf4-5365adf97892\",\"id\":\"c74d68a4-0461-4498-bf12-49231b042d3e\",\"isPublishing\":false,\"kind\":\"editorial\",\"lastPublication\":\"2026-08-27T13:04:39.326Z\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-27T13:23:46.924Z\",\"parentId\":null,\"postHash\":\"fa1efc00-9bb0-11f1-96cb-810fa8cb8316\",\"publication\":\"2026-08-27T13:04:39.326Z\",\"tenantId\":\"g1\",\"type\":\"post-mais-lidas\",\"versionId\":\"bb4b210b-ad14-4f46-9c69-13cea07761ab\"},{\"area\":\"\",\"children\":null,\"config\":{\"apiName\":\"post-agrupador-horizontal-g1\"},\"content\":{\"missingFields\":false,\"posts\":[{\"image\":{\"crop\":{\"bottom\":1163,\"height\":815,\"left\":703,\"right\":1517,\"top\":348,\"width\":814},\"height\":1200,\"id\":\"7afa59a1-d7e1-44a4-9613-511c90b95b0f\",\"isAnimated\":false,\"name\":\"Animal chegou em Rio Branco nessa segunda-feira (21), por volta das 23h\",\"rightsHolder\":\"Reprodução/Rede Amazônica\",\"sizes\":{\"postM\":{\"height\":180,\"ssl\":true,\"url\":\"https://s2-g1.glbimg.com/jk_ow5q_y94I9HMzDOyJmUEcrX0=/703x348:1517x1163/320x180/https://i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_59edd422c0c84a879bd37670ae4f538a/internal_photos/bs/2026/q/1/cMfHE4SFaRpU97PNMgkw/midia-de-distribuicao-g1-2026-09-